## All the little parts

| Ref | Value | Between |
|---|---|---|
| R_PB1 | 10k | Power button line and ground (keeps it low when not pressed) |
| R_S1 | 6.8k | Power button line and pin 15 |
| R_S2 | 22k | Pin 15 and ground (with R_S1 this makes the 3V-ish divider) |
| R_T1 | 330k | Power button line and the hold timer |
| R_B1 | 100k | Hold timer and the transistor's base |
| R_OFF1 | 1k | Orange Pi pin 12 and the power switch's OFF pin |
| R_EN1 | 4.7k | Boost EN and ground |
| R_PGUP1 | 10k | 3.3V and pin 27 |
| R_PGDN1 | 10k | 3.3V and pin 29 |
| R_MENU1 | 10k | 3.3V and pin 31 |
| R_SQW1 | 10k | 3.3V and pin 28 |
| R_CC1 | 5.1k | USB CC line and ground |
| R_ML1 | 10k | Sound card left and amp input |
| R_MR1 | 10k | Sound card right and amp input |
| D_T1 | 1N4148 | Empties the hold timer when you let go of POWER (band side goes to the power button line) |
| Q_OFF1 | 2N3904 | E = ground, B = from R_B1, C = power switch CTRL |
| C_T1 | 47uF 10V | Hold timer to ground (long leg to the square pad) |
| C_5V1 | 470uF 10V | 5V rail to ground |
| C_BAT1 | 100uF 10V | Battery + to ground |

